{
  "schema_version": "1.9.2",
  "id": "USN-9201-1",
  "summary": "network-manager vulnerability",
  "details": "Juthawong Naisanguansee discovered that NetworkManager on Ubuntu\nincorrectly granted the whoopsie user unrestricted D-Bus access to\nroot-only methods. A local attacker who can execute code as the whoopsie\nuser could possibly use this issue to disrupt system networking or alter\nNetworkManager logging and connection configurations.",
